WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.349
The Class is built: Telo Ride 1's home screen, with the one class and one start

00:00:07.349 --> 00:00:08.072
button.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:14.842
The header shows the bike, and leads to Connect Bike. Beside the parked video are

00:00:14.842 --> 00:00:18.099
the class's name, its summary and its twenty minutes.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:27.927
With the bike connected, the button reads Start class. With no bike it reads Connect

00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:30.632
your bike, and says why the class needs it.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:41.316
New here is Ride with: the class video, or Ibiza Sunset Strip. The choice is kept on

00:00:41.316 --> 00:00:45.194
this device, and the course's still takes the video's box.

00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:53.700
A browser that cannot draw the course says so and keeps the class video. And when

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:56.648
the video cannot load, its cover stands alone.

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:07.004
Start class follows the choice. The class video rides at once, with the video alone.

00:01:07.004 --> 00:01:12.066
Ibiza is still the ride carried over, with its loading screen, until its own journey

00:01:12.066 --> 00:01:12.969
builds it.

00:01:17.428 --> 00:01:22.113
The Class from a phone to a desktop. Fitting it to one screen is a later slice.

00:01:27.751 --> 00:01:32.987
Fourteen specs came first, and thirteen failed. Now one hundred and eighty-six specs

00:01:32.987 --> 00:01:34.845
and every unit test pass.

00:01:40.656 --> 00:01:46.310
Telo Ride 1, from the Telo family, is the focused edition of Telo Ride: one class,

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:47.506
nothing else.

00:01:47.852 --> 00:01:52.804
It pairs with a smart bike at home over Bluetooth, plays the class video, or draws

00:01:52.804 --> 00:01:57.816
the Ibiza Sunset Strip course to music if the rider chooses it, and sets the bike's

00:01:57.816 --> 00:02:01.317
resistance for every interval while the rider pedals.

00:02:01.662 --> 00:02:05.638
Connect the bike, take the class, see your number, and come back to beat it.
